{"server":"en","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-06_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-06","title":"Catastrophe","storyCode":"1-6","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b32ede69f5e1af51bd8274994aeb85e5c4a5d88e975e6ab9869922ac82158bef","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"A woman stands atop a tall building and takes in the herculean efforts of the Doctor and the rescue squad.\nThen, as if responding to her poetic words, the sky sank into a pool of blood.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第九关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Indeed. They don't know that Faust is following them. I received some information from one of his scouts."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island is trapped around the perimeter of the city center."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Insects as they might be, they still might take advantage of the confusion caused by the Catastrophe to make their escape."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Given their understanding of the situation in Chernobog, they could potentially interfere with our plans."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"... At least, getting rid of them won't do us any harm."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Chernobog bastards! It's because of you, it's all your fault... that us Infected became like this!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Get lost!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"These people, it's like they're just waiting to die! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Why is Reunion going completely berserk?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Why are they sending so many members out here now?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"This makes no sense! There's no reason for them to be defending this place so staunchly!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island Operators, stand your ground! Push Reunion back and open up an escape route!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"So that's the 'Rhodes Island' that I've been hearing so much about? Heh... How heroic."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"... Falling rocks? At a time like this?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't stop moving! Maintain our defensive line!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Something's not right... These rocks are coming from the buildings..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you talking about..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"It's here! It's here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Ahaha... salvation has come for us! Judgment day has come!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Ahhh, arghhhh--*CRASH!*"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Ahhh, arghhhh--*CRASH!*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"They were... crushed by something?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Was it one of you... who attacked them?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Or were they..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dobermann! Look, the sky...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"The sky was dyed a bloody crimson..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"'Boiling dark clouds, tumbling in flames...'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't panic!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Keep your senses about you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"... We still can make it out of this alive if we act decisively!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"'...As terror strips away their voices, the land falls into silence.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"'The titanic Originium lowers its head...'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"'...and falls upon the scorched shadow of death.'"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Talulah."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What do we do next?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"... Perhaps they will be able to survive the Catastrophe."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Finish off the stragglers."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Very well."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Even though I figured that Reunion would be using the Catastrophe to take their revenge..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"I didn't expect them to use it to completely destroy Chernobog..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Rather than vengeance, this seems more like a manifesto..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Something about the Era of the Infected... or something like that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaahh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"The entire sky... is crashing down..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch out! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"What's that..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Be more alert!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"-- Oh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Protect the Medic - hurry and take her someplace safe!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"All operators, find cover!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"All teams, prepare to... weather the Catastrophe!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["???"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["Guard"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Medic"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["Dobermann"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["Nearl"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["Crownslayer"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["???"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["Mephisto"]}]}
